<< /A 77 0 R /Alt (ROC curve for academic performance classification showing the true positive rate versus false positive rate, with an AUC of zero point six eight two and a diagonal reference line for random performance.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 52 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
